+| Body-mutation proof | `kprove spec.k --definition verification-kompiled-mutated --spec-module SPEC --claims SPEC.valid-name-txt` (from `/tmp/audit-work/body-mutation`) | 1, expected stuck claim | `04-body-mutation-kprove.log` |
