+
+The ten labels were `empty-name`, `bad-dot-count`, `bad-initial`,
+`bad-extension`, `too-many-digits-txt`, `too-many-digits-exe`,
+`too-many-digits-dll`, `valid-name-txt`, `valid-name-exe`, and
